            "review_title": "Review at L'Escargot",
            "review_text": "Anne P\nMalaga, Spain6 contributions\n0\nDont go\nJun 2018 • Couples\nI came for a salad. I chose a greek salad, which seemed good, green salad with many cucumbers tomato and cheese on the top (Normal greek salad are only tomato cucumbers olives and feta cheese).\nThe girl filled half a box, with (honestly) three bigs salad leaves, and almost nothing else. I asked for more, since the box was half empty (you pay for the box), and she added more green salad. So it wasnt a greek salad at all, 90% salad and 10% other. Anyway, wasnt good, either the sauce.\nThe spinach lasagna were disgusting, I threw it away.\nRead more\nWritten June 4, 2018",
